A Spanish National Police special unit made the Mallorca arrest in the operation with the BKA and ZIT, and the relaunch was built a few days after the December 2024 takedown of one of the central German-speaking underground marketplaces. About €194,000 in assets were preliminarily seized, and the seized user and transaction data are expected to support further investigations into users and operators mainly in German-speaking countries; the takedown asks no defender decision.
